      "label": "nushi_iwa_0005_friend_04",
      "hash64": "0261B2A911A5D962",
      "text": "Maybe it’s way up high on a cliff or something?\\c\\n...Nah, that’s impossible!\\c\\nI don’t think it’d be hiding somewhere that tricky,\\nso don’t go falling off any cliffs or anything trying\\r\\nto search it out somewhere too strange.\\c\\nMaybe just give your map app a look if you’re\\nfeeling stumped? It’s pretty handy![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
